#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:33
msgid "Editing"
msgstr "Editovanie"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:36
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Editing is done in the :ref:`timeline`. Add a clip by dragging it from "
#| "the :doc:`project bin</project_and_asset_management/project_bin>` or the :"
#| "ref:`ui-monitors`. Once a clip is dropped on a track, it can be moved "
#| "(drag and drop it) to another place on the same track or onto another "
#| "track."
msgid ""
"Editing is done in the :ref:`timeline`. Add a clip by dragging it from the :"
"doc:`project bin </project_and_asset_management/project_bin>` or the :ref:"
"`ui-monitors`. Once a clip is dropped on a track, it can be moved (drag and "
"drop it) to another place on the same track or onto another track."
msgstr ""
"Strihanie sa vykonáva na :ref:`timeline`. Pridajte klip jeho pretiahnutím z :"
"doc:`koša projektu</project_and_asset_management/project_bin>` alebo z :ref:"
"`ui-monitors`. Po umiestnení klipu na stopu ho môžete presunúť (pretiahnuť a "
"pustiť) na iné miesto tej istej stopy alebo na inú stopu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:45
msgid ""
"Editing with keyboard shortcuts can speed up the editing work, and you can "
"do editing steps that are not possible or not as quick and easy with the "
"mouse. Working with keyboard shortcuts from version 19.08 onwards is "
"different as in previous Kdenlive versions. Mouse operations have not "
"changed and work as before. See `3 Point Editing`_"
msgstr ""
"Strihanie pomocou klávesových skratiek môže urýchliť prácu a umožňuje "
"vykonávať kroky strihania, ktoré nie sú možné alebo nie sú také rýchle a "
"jednoduché pomocou myši. Práca s klávesovými skratkami od verzie 19.08 sa "
"líši od predchádzajúcich verzií Kdenlive. Operácie myšou sa nezmenili a "
"fungujú ako predtým. Pozrite si `3 Point Editing`_"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:49
msgid "Seeking through your project"
msgstr "Pohyb v projekte"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:51
msgid ""
"The timeline cursor shows your current position in the project. The "
"positions of the cursors on the timeline ruler and Project Monitor are "
"always in sync. Position can be moved in the following ways:"
msgstr ""
"Kurzor časovej osi zobrazuje vašu aktuálnu pozíciu v projekte. Pozície "
"kurzorov na pravítku časovej osi a monitore projektu sú vždy "
"synchronizované. Pozíciu je možné presunúť nasledujúcimi spôsobmi:"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:54
msgid ""
"Keyboard shortcut: right / left arrows for one frame, Shift+ right / left "
"for 1 second"
msgstr ""
"Klávesová skratka: šípka vpravo / vľavo pre jeden snímok, Shift+ vpravo / "
"vľavo pre 1 sekundu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:57
msgid ""
"Clicking/dragging in the :ref:`timeline` or in an empty area of the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Kliknutím/pretiahnutím na :ref:`timeline` alebo na prázdnu oblasť časovej "
"osi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:60
msgid "Clicking/dragging in the :ref:`ui-monitors` ruler."
msgstr "Kliknutím/pretiahnutím na pravítku :ref:`ui-monitors`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:63
msgid ""
"Rotating the mouse wheel while the pointer is over the :ref:`timeline` or "
"over the :ref:`ui-monitors`"
msgstr ""
"Otáčaním kolieska myši, keď je kurzor nad :ref:`timeline` alebo nad :ref:`ui-"
"monitors`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:66
msgid "Editing the timecode in the :ref:`ui-monitors`  timecode widget"
msgstr "Úpravou časového kódu v miniaplikácii časového kódu :ref:`ui-monitors`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:69
msgid ""
"Clicking the up or down arrows on the :ref:`ui-monitors` timecode widget"
msgstr ""
"Kliknutím na šípky nahor alebo nadol v miniaplikácii časového kódu :ref:`ui-"
"monitors`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:73
msgid "Cutting a Clip"
msgstr "Strihanie klipu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:75
msgid ""
"To cut a clip, the easiest way is to place the timeline cursor where you "
"want to cut the clip, then select the clip (left click in it) and use the "
"menu :menuselection:`Timeline --> Current Clip --> Cut Clip` (default "
"shortcut: :kbd:`Shift + R`)."
msgstr ""
"Na zostrihanie klipu je najjednoduchší spôsob umiestniť kurzor časovej osi "
"na miesto, kde chcete klip zostrihnúť, potom vyberte klip (kliknite naň "
"ľavým tlačidlom) a použite ponuku :menuselection:`Timeline --> Current Clip "
"--> Cut Clip` (predvolená skratka: :kbd:`Shift + R`)."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:78
msgid "Or  :menuselection:`Right Click --> Cut Clip`"
msgstr "Alebo :menuselection:`Right Click --> Cut Clip`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:81
msgid "Alternatively - use the `Spacer Tool`_."
msgstr "Prípadne použite `Spacer Tool`_."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:85
msgid "Resizing a Clip"
msgstr "Zmena veľkosti klipu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:87
msgid ""
"A clip can be resized from its start or end by dragging its left or right "
"edge. If you want a more precise resize, you can place the timeline cursor "
"wherever you want the resize to end and use the menu :menuselection:"
"`Timeline --> Resize Item Start` (default shortcut: :kbd:`(` or :"
"menuselection:`Timeline --> Resize Item End` (default shortcut: :kbd:`)`)"
msgstr ""
"Klip je možné zmeniť veľkosť od jeho začiatku alebo konca pretiahnutím jeho "
"ľavého alebo pravého okraja. Ak chcete presnejšiu zmenu veľkosti, môžete "
"umiestniť kurzor časovej osi tam, kde má zmena veľkosti skončiť, a použiť "
"ponuku :menuselection:`Timeline --> Resize Item Start` (predvolená skratka: :"
"kbd:`(` alebo :menuselection:`Timeline --> Resize Item End` (predvolená "
"skratka: :kbd:`)`)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:90
msgid ""
"To even more precisely control the length of a clip, double click it in the "
"timeline and adjust its duration using the **Clip duration** dialog. You can "
"have frame-level accuracy with this method."
msgstr ""
"Na ešte presnejšie ovládanie dĺžky klipu naň dvakrát kliknite na časovej osi "
"a upravte jeho trvanie pomocou dialógu **Clip duration**. Táto metóda "
"umožňuje presnosť na úrovni snímok."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:96
msgid ""
"You can also resize a clip by cutting it with the  `Razor Tool`_ and then "
"deleting the bit you do not want."
msgstr ""
"Klip môžete zmeniť veľkosť aj jeho strihnutím pomocou `Razor Tool`_ a "
"následným vymazaním časti, ktorú nechcete."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:100
msgid ""
"Adjust AV clips independently with :kbd:`Shift + resize` to resize only "
"audio or video part of a clip."
msgstr ""
"Upravte AV klipy nezávisle pomocou :kbd:`Shift + resize` na zmenu veľkosti "
"iba zvukovej alebo obrazovej časti klipu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:102
msgid ""
":kbd:`alt + Move` in timeline allows to move the audio or video part to "
"another track independently."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`alt + Move` na časovej osi umožňuje presunúť zvukovú alebo obrazovú "
"časť na inú stopu nezávisle."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:110
msgid ""
"Select a clip in the project bin. When resizing this clip in the timeline "
"the clip monitor shows a yellow indicator relative to the original clip "
"length."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte klip v koši projektu. Pri zmene veľkosti tohto klipu na časovej osi "
"monitor klipu zobrazí žltý indikátor relatívny k pôvodnej dĺžke klipu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:116
msgid "Resizing multiple timeline items"
msgstr "Zmena veľkosti viacerých položiek časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:120
msgid ""
"Select several clips in the timeline. Double click on one of the clips. The "
"Duration dialog window pops up. Enable :guilabel:`Apply duration to all "
"items`, otherwise nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte niekoľko klipov na časovej osi. Dvakrát kliknite na jeden z klipov. "
"Zobrazí sa dialógové okno Duration. Povoľte :guilabel:`Apply duration to all "
"items`, inak sa nič nestane."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:122
msgid ""
"The duration/resize is linked to the start position of each clip. Meaning if "
"you select three clips and reduce the duration you get gaps between each "
"clip as the start position of each clip is fixed."
msgstr ""
"Trvanie/zmena veľkosti je prepojená so začiatočnou pozíciou každého klipu. "
"To znamená, že ak vyberiete tri klipy a skrátite trvanie, medzi každým "
"klipom vzniknú medzery, pretože začiatočná pozícia každého klipu je fixná."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:124
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Position` show the start position of the most left selected clip"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Position` zobrazuje začiatočnú pozíciu najviac vľavo vybraného "
"klipu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration` shows the length of the first selected clip done by :"
"kbd:`Shift + LMB`. When selected by :kbd:`Shift + drag` it show the length "
"of the most left clip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Duration` zobrazuje dĺžku prvého vybraného klipu vybraného "
"pomocou :kbd:`Shift + LMB`. Pri výbere pomocou :kbd:`Shift + drag` zobrazuje "
"dĺžku najviac vľavo umiestneného klipu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:134
msgid ""
"Selection with :kbd:`Shift + drag` shows the length of the most left clip"
msgstr ""
"Výber pomocou :kbd:`Shift + drag` zobrazuje dĺžku najviac vľavo umiestneného "
"klipu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:136
msgid ""
"Shorten and lengthen duration: The clips get shortened/lengthened but keep "
"their starting position"
msgstr ""
"Skrátenie a predĺženie trvania: Klipy sa skrátia/predĺžia, ale zachovajú "
"svoju začiatočnú pozíciu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:138
msgid "Clips attached to each other: You cannot lengthen the clips"
msgstr "Klipy priradené k sebe: Klipy nie je možné predĺžiť"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:142
msgid "Change duration with :guilabel:`Ripple resize` enabled"
msgstr "Zmena trvania s povoleným :guilabel:`Ripple resize`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:148
msgid ""
"Selection with :kbd:`Shift + click` shows the length of the first selected "
"clip"
msgstr ""
"Výber pomocou :kbd:`Shift + click` zobrazuje dĺžku prvého vybraného klipu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:150
msgid ""
"Shorten and lengthen duration: The starting position of the left most "
"selected clip on each track is fixed. Any gaps between clips are kept."
msgstr ""
"Skrátenie a predĺženie trvania: Začiatočná pozícia najviac vľavo vybraného "
"klipu na každej stope je fixná. Všetky medzery medzi klipmi sú zachované."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:152
msgid ""
"Clips attached to each other: All clips attached to the right will lengthen "
"or shorten according to the left most clip, keeping their attachment."
msgstr ""
"Klipy priradené k sebe: Všetky klipy priradené vpravo sa predĺžia alebo "
"skrátia podľa najviac vľavo umiestneného klipu, pričom si zachovajú svoje "
"priradenie."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:158
msgid "Edit an Animation"
msgstr "Úprava animácie"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:163
msgid "This requires Glaxnimate version >= 0.5.1"
msgstr "Vyžaduje sa Glaxnimate verzia >= 0.5.1"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:165
msgid ""
"Double click on an animation clip in the timeline and this will open "
"Glaxnimate."
msgstr ""
"Dvakrát kliknite na animovaný klip na časovej osi a otvorí sa Glaxnimate."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:170
msgid ""
"The background of the animation in Kdenlive will also be shown in Glaxnimate."
msgstr "Pozadie animácie v Kdenlive bude zobrazené aj v Glaxnimate."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:175
msgid ""
"It is possible to have several Glaxnimate instances open, but the background "
"will only be send to the one opened first in Glaxnimate. If you like to see "
"the Kdenlive background of another animation clip, save the animation and "
"close Glaxnimate before you double click another animation clip."
msgstr ""
"Je možné mať otvorených niekoľko inštancií Glaxnimate, ale pozadie bude "
"odoslané len tej, ktorá bola v Glaxnimate otvorená ako prvá. Ak chcete "
"vidieť pozadie Kdenlive iného animovaného klipu, uložte animáciu a zatvorte "
"Glaxnimate predtým, ako dvakrát kliknete na iný animovaný klip."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:181
msgid "Change Speed of a Clip"
msgstr "Zmena rýchlosti klipu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:188
msgid ""
"Adjust the speed of a clip by pressing :kbd:`CTRL + dragging` a clip in the "
"timeline."
msgstr ""
"Upravte rýchlosť klipu stlačením :kbd:`CTRL + dragging` klipu na časovej osi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:190
msgid "Doing with right click on the clip see :ref:`change_speed`."
msgstr "Pomocou pravého kliknutia na klip pozrite :ref:`change_speed`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:196
msgid "Removing Space Between Clips"
msgstr "Odstraňovanie medzier medzi klipmi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:198
msgid ""
"Right click in the space between the clips and choose :menuselection:`Remove "
"Space`. Be aware however that if you have clips on multiple tracks in the "
"timeline and they are not grouped, then removing space may disturb the "
"alignment of the clips between the different tracks – the space is only "
"removed from the timeline where you clicked.  Under this situation it may be "
"safer to use the `Spacer Tool`_."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite pravým tlačidlom na medzeru medzi klipmi a vyberte :menuselection:"
"`Remove Space`. Upozorňujeme však, že ak máte klipy na viacerých stopách "
"časovej osi a nie sú zoskupené, odstránenie medzery môže narušiť zarovnanie "
"klipov medzi rôznymi stopami – medzera sa odstráni len z časovej osi, na "
"ktorú ste klikli. V tejto situácii môže byť bezpečnejšie použiť `Spacer "
"Tool`_."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:205
msgid ""
":menuselection:`Timeline --> Current track --> Remove All Spaces After "
"Cursor`"
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Timeline --> Current track --> Remove All Spaces After "
"Cursor`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:207
msgid ""
"It handles AV clips as 1 element, doesn't matter on which track they are. "
"This function is only in the Timeline menu available this to avoid clutter."
msgstr ""
"Spracováva AV klipy ako 1 prvok, bez ohľadu na to, na ktorej stope sa "
"nachádzajú. Táto funkcia je dostupná len v ponuke Timeline, aby sa predišlo "
"neporiadku."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:209
msgid "More details see :ref:`timeline_space-remove`."
msgstr "Ďalšie podrobnosti pozrite :ref:`timeline_space-remove`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:215
msgid "Adjust timeline zone"
msgstr "Zdvihnúť zónu náhľadu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:219
msgid ":kbd:`Shift+z` adjusts timeline zone to selected clips"
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift+z` nastaví zónu časovej osi na vybrané klipy"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:227
msgid "Timeline Toolbar"
msgstr "Panel časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:229
msgid ""
"There is a toolbar between monitors and the timeline that controls various "
"aspects of the editor."
msgstr ""
"Medzi monitormi a časovou osou sa nachádza panel nástrojov, ktorý ovláda "
"rôzne aspekty editora."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:235
msgid "`Track Compositing`_ drop down."
msgstr "Rozbaľovacia ponuka `Track Compositing`_."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:241
msgid ""
"Track compositing is now a simple checkbox instead of the deprecated none/"
"high resolution choice."
msgstr ""
"Skladanie stôp je teraz jednoduchým zaškrtávacím políčkom namiesto "
"zastaranej voľby žiadne/vysoké rozlíšenie."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:243
msgid "When enabled Kdenlive is set to :ref:`track_compositing_hq`"
msgstr "Keď je povolené, Kdenlive je nastavené na :ref:`track_compositing_hq`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:245
msgid "When disabled Kdenlive is set to :ref:`track_compositing_none`"
msgstr ""
"Keď je zakázané, Kdenlive je nastavené na :ref:`track_compositing_none`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:249
msgid "1a, 1b and 1c cannot be selected anymore."
msgstr "1a, 1b a 1c už nie je možné vybrať."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:251
msgid "1a. :ref:`track_compositing_none`"
msgstr "1a. :ref:`track_compositing_none`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:253
msgid "1b. :ref:`track_compositing_preview`"
msgstr "1b. :ref:`track_compositing_preview`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:255
msgid "1c. :ref:`track_compositing_hq`"
msgstr "1c. :ref:`track_compositing_hq`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:257
msgid ""
"1d. **Mixed Audio tracks** changes the order in which tracks are displayed "
"to mixed audio and video tracks.  For example, from the bottom of the "
"timeline to the top of the timeline: A1, V1, A2, V2, A3, V3"
msgstr ""
"1d. **Mixed Audio tracks** mení poradie zobrazenia stôp na zmiešané zvukové "
"a obrazové stopy. Napríklad zdola časovej osi nahor: A1, V1, A2, V2, A3, V3"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:259
msgid ""
"1e. **Split Audio tracks** changes the order in which tracks are displayed "
"to separate audio and video tracks.  For example, from the bottom of the "
"timeline to the top of the timeline: A1, A2, A1, V1, V2, V3"
msgstr ""
"1e. **Split Audio tracks** mení poradie zobrazenia stôp na oddelené zvukové "
"a obrazové stopy. Napríklad zdola časovej osi nahor: A1, A2, A1, V1, V2, V3"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:261
msgid ""
"1f. **Split Audio tracks (reverse)** changes the order in which tracks are "
"displayed to separate audio and video tracks with the audio tracks in "
"reverse order.  For example, from the bottom of the timeline to the top of "
"the timeline: A1, A2, A3, V1, V2, V3"
msgstr ""
"1f. **Split Audio tracks (reverse)** mení poradie zobrazenia stôp na "
"oddelené zvukové a obrazové stopy so zvukovými stopami v opačnom poradí. "
"Napríklad zdola časovej osi nahor: A1, A2, A3, V1, V2, V3"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:263
msgid ""
"**Timeline Edit Mode**  Drop Down. These same settings can be found under "
"the :menuselection:`Tool` menu."
msgstr ""
"**Timeline Edit Mode** – rozbaľovacia ponuka. Rovnaké nastavenia nájdete v "
"ponuke :menuselection:`Tool`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:265
msgid "2a. **Timeline Normal Mode**"
msgstr "2a. **Timeline Normal Mode**"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:267
msgid "2b. **Timeline Overwrite Mode**"
msgstr "Režim úpravy časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:269
msgid "2c. **Timeline Insert Mode**"
msgstr "Režim úpravy časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:271
msgid ""
"Use timeline zone |timeline-use-zone-on| / Do not use timeline zone |"
"timeline-use-zone-off| for insert (toggles). See :doc:`/tips_and_tricks/"
"useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Použiť zónu časovej osi |timeline-use-zone-on| / Nepoužívať zónu časovej osi "
"|timeline-use-zone-off| pre vkladanie (prepínač). Ďalšie podrobnosti "
"pozrite :doc:`/tips_and_tricks/useful_info/"
"insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:274
msgid "**Tool Group** (one of these 3 can be active)"
msgstr "**Tool Group** (jeden z týchto 3 môže byť aktívny)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:276
msgid "Active buttons are grey."
msgstr "Aktívne tlačidlá sú sivé."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:279
msgid ""
"`Selection Tool`_ - Also selected with the 'S' hotkey.  Allows the selection "
"and manipulation of clips on the timeline"
msgstr ""
"`Selection Tool`_ – Vyberá sa aj klávesovou skratkou „S\". Umožňuje výber a "
"manipuláciu s klipmi na časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:281
msgid ""
"`Razor Tool`_ - Also selected with the 'X' hotkey, or to cut at the point of "
"the play head use \"Shift-R\". This allows a clip to be cut into two clips."
msgstr ""
"`Razor Tool`_ – Vyberá sa aj klávesovou skratkou 'X', alebo na zostrihanie v "
"mieste polohy prehrávania použite „Shift-R\". Umožňuje zostrihanie klipu na "
"dva klipy."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:283
msgid ""
"`Spacer Tool`_ - Also selected with the 'M' hotkey.  This tool will select "
"all clips at one point in the timeline and allow them to be shifted at once."
msgstr ""
"`Spacer Tool`_ – Vyberá sa aj klávesovou skratkou „M\". Tento nástroj "
"vyberie všetky klipy v jednom bode časovej osi a umožní ich naraz posunúť."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:285
msgid ""
"Position indicator - displays the time point or frame number of the location "
"of the hovering mouse on the left side, and the total length of the project "
"on the right side."
msgstr ""
"Indikátor pozície – zobrazuje časový bod alebo číslo snímky miesta, kde sa "
"nachádza myš na ľavej strane, a celkovú dĺžku projektu na pravej strane."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:287
msgid "7a. **hh:mm:ss:ff;** Sets the position indicator to display time units"
msgstr ""
"7a. **hh:mm:ss:ff;** Nastaví indikátor pozície na zobrazenie časových "
"jednotiek"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:289
msgid "7b. **Frames** Sets the position indicator to display frames"
msgstr "7b. **Frames** Nastaví indikátor pozície na zobrazenie snímok"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:291
msgid ""
"**Mix Clips** - allows same-track transitions to be applied between two "
"clips. See :ref:`same_track_transition` for a detailed explanation."
msgstr ""
"**Mix Clips** – umožňuje aplikovanie prechodov na rovnakej stope medzi dvoma "
"klipmi. Podrobné vysvetlenie pozrite :ref:`same_track_transition`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:293
msgid ""
"Insert Clip Zone in Timeline. See :doc:`/tips_and_tricks/useful_info/"
"insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Vloženie zóny klipu do časovej osi. Ďalšie podrobnosti pozrite :doc:`/"
"tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:295
msgid ""
"Overwrite Clip Zone in Timeline. See :doc:`/tips_and_tricks/useful_info/"
"insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Prepísanie zóny klipu na časovej osi. Ďalšie podrobnosti pozrite :doc:`/"
"tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:297
msgid "Extract Timeline Zone"
msgstr "Extrahovať časové pásmo"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:299
msgid "Lift Timeline Zone"
msgstr "Zdvihnúť zónu náhľadu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:301
msgid "Favourite Effects"
msgstr "Obľúbené efekty"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:303
msgid "Start Preview Render"
msgstr "Spustiť renderovanie náhľadu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:305
msgid "14a. Stop Preview Render"
msgstr "14a. Zastaviť náhľadové renderovanie"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:307
msgid "14b. Add Preview Zone"
msgstr "14b. Pridať zónu náhľadu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:309
msgid "14c. Remove Preview Zone"
msgstr "14c. Odstrániť zónu náhľadu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:311
msgid "14d. Remove All Preview Zones"
msgstr "14d. Odstrániť všetky zóny náhľadu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:313
msgid "14e. Automatic Preview"
msgstr "14e. Automatický náhľad"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:315
msgid "14f. Disable Timeline Preview"
msgstr "14f. Zakázať náhľad časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:317
msgid "14g. Manage Cached Data"
msgstr "14g. Spravovať uložené dáta"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:327
msgid ""
"Items 14, 14a-14g are covered in detail by the Tips & Tricks chapter about :"
"doc:`/tips_and_tricks/tips_and_tricks/timeline_preview_rendering`."
msgstr ""
"Položky 14, 14a–14g sú podrobne vysvetlené v kapitole Tipy a triky o :doc:`/"
"tips_and_tricks/tips_and_tricks/timeline_preview_rendering`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:329
msgid ""
"Show/Hide the :ref:`audio_mixer` tool.  The audio mixer tool allows audio to "
"be managed in the project."
msgstr ""
"Zobraziť/skryť nástroj :ref:`audio_mixer`. Nástroj audio mixér umožňuje "
"správu zvuku v projekte."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:331
msgid ""
"Show/Hide the :ref:`effects-subtitles` Tool.  This will show or hide the "
"subtitle track where subtitles can be created or edited in the project."
msgstr ""
"Zobraziť/skryť nástroj :ref:`effects-subtitles`. Zobrazí alebo skryje stopu "
"titulkov, kde je možné v projekte vytvárať alebo upravovať titulky."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:337
msgid "Track Compositing"
msgstr "Kombinovanie stôp"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:341
msgid "The track compositing applies uniformly to all tracks in your timeline."
msgstr ""
"Skladanie stôp sa uplatňuje rovnomerne na všetky stopy vo vašej časovej osi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:345
msgid ""
"Under certain compositing conditions, if you see the outcome of a transition "
"not to be what you would expect, try to switch track compositing off for a "
"quick check. If the oddity is gone, then this is an interference between the "
"automatic timeline track compositing and your user transitions."
msgstr ""
"Za určitých podmienok skladania, ak vidíte výsledok prechodu iný, než by ste "
"očakávali, skúste skladanie stôp vypnúť na rýchlu kontrolu. Ak zvláštnosť "
"zmizne, ide o interferenciu medzi automatickým skladaním stôp časovej osi a "
"vašimi používateľskými prechodmi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:349
msgid ""
"Track compositing is now a simple checkbox instead of the none/high "
"resolution choice."
msgstr ""
"Skladanie stôp je teraz jednoduchým zaškrtávacím políčkom namiesto voľby "
"žiadne/vysoké rozlíšenie."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:355
msgid "High Quality"
msgstr "Vysoká kvalita"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:359
msgid ""
"When track compositing is set to High-Quality tracks with alpha channel "
"information will be automatically composited with the other tracks using an "
"algorithm that is somewhat slower than the algorithm used with :ref:"
"`track_compositing_preview` but which retains higher fidelity color "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Keď je skladanie stôp nastavené na vysokú kvalitu, stopy s informáciami o "
"alfa kanáli budú automaticky skombinované s ostatnými stopami pomocou "
"algoritmu, ktorý je o niečo pomalší ako algoritmus používaný s :ref:"
"`track_compositing_preview`, ale zachováva farebné informácie s vyššou "
"vernosťou."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:365
msgid "None"
msgstr "Žiadne"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:369
msgid ""
"When Track Compositing is set to None you will not get tracks with alpha "
"channel information to composite with the other tracks unless an explicit "
"composite or affine transition is added between the clips. This is basically "
"kind of an expert mode when you need full control over any compositing in "
"your timeline."
msgstr ""
"Keď je skladanie stôp nastavené na Žiadne, stopy s informáciami o alfa "
"kanáli sa nebudú skladať s ostatnými stopami, pokiaľ medzi klipmi nie je "
"pridaný explicitný kompozitný alebo afinný prechod. Ide v podstate o režim "
"pre expertov, keď potrebujete úplnú kontrolu nad akýmkoľvek skladaním na "
"vašej časovej osi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:375
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Náhľad"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:381
msgid ""
"Final rendering always uses either **High Quality** or **None**. So Preview "
"quality is, well, for preview only."
msgstr ""
"Finálne renderovanie vždy používa buď **Vysokú kvalitu** alebo **Žiadnu**. "
"Takže kvalita náhľadu je, nuž, len pre náhľad."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:383
msgid ""
"When track compositing is set to Preview tracks with alpha channel "
"information will be automatically composited with the other tracks using an "
"algorithm that is somewhat faster than the algorithm used with :ref:"
"`track_compositing_hq` but which slightly degrades the colors."
msgstr ""
"Keď je skladanie stôp nastavené na Náhľad, stopy s informáciami o alfa "
"kanáli budú automaticky skombinované s ostatnými stopami pomocou algoritmu, "
"ktorý je o niečo rýchlejší ako algoritmus používaný s :ref:"
"`track_compositing_hq`, ale ktorý mierne zhoršuje farby."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:389
msgid "Active track"
msgstr "Aktívna stopa"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:399
msgid "An :term:`active track`"
msgstr "Aktívna stopa (:term:`active track`)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:403
msgid ""
"**1** Target track (3-point editing). The highlighted target strip indicates "
"that in the project bin an A/V clip is selected (the selected clip has an "
"audio and video part)."
msgstr ""
"**1** Cieľová stopa (3-bodové strihanie). Zvýraznený cieľový prúžok "
"signalizuje, že v koši projektu je vybraný A/V klip (vybraný klip má zvukovú "
"a obrazovú časť)."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:405
msgid "**2** Active track (3-point editing)"
msgstr "**2** Aktívna stopa (3-bodové strihanie)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:407
msgid "**3** Track header"
msgstr "**3** Hlavička stopy"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:409
msgid "**4** Empty part of the track"
msgstr "**4** Prázdna časť stopy"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:411
msgid ""
"Only active tracks can accept clips or react to an edit function. An :term:"
"`active track` is indicated by a:"
msgstr ""
"Len aktívne stopy môžu prijímať klipy alebo reagovať na funkciu úprav. :term:"
"`active track` je označená:"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:413
msgid "highlighted track number (**2**) (for 3-point editing)"
msgstr "zvýrazneným číslom stopy (**2**) (pre 3-bodové strihanie)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:415
msgid ""
"blueish or brownish track (**3 4**) (depends on the color scheme), working "
"with the mouse or insert clip by paste"
msgstr ""
"modrastou alebo hnedastou stopou (**3 4**) (závisí od farebnej schémy), pri "
"práci s myšou alebo vložení klipu prilepením"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:417
msgid ""
"When you work with the mouse Kdenlive make a track active as you drop a clip "
"to the timeline or you select a clip."
msgstr ""
"Pri práci s myšou Kdenlive aktivuje stopu, keď na ňu pustíte klip alebo keď "
"vyberiete klip."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:419
msgid "Make a track active by:"
msgstr "Aktivovať stopu:"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:421
msgid "click into the track header (**3**)"
msgstr "kliknutím do hlavičky stopy (**3**)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:423
msgid ""
"double click into an empty part of the track (**4**) (the playhead moves to "
"this point too). This is useful when you copy & paste clips."
msgstr ""
"dvojitým kliknutím do prázdnej časti stopy (**4**) (poloha prehrávania sa "
"tiež presunie na tento bod). Toto je užitočné pri kopírovaní a vkladaní "
"klipov."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:425
msgid ":kbd:`1-9` select a video track"
msgstr ":kbd:`1-9` výber obrazovej stopy"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:427
msgid ":kbd:`alt+1-9` select an audio track"
msgstr ":kbd:`alt+1-9` výber zvukovej stopy"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:429
msgid "arrow key up/down"
msgstr "klávesa šípky nahor/nadol"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:431
msgid "For 3-point editing"
msgstr "Pre 3-bodové strihanie"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:433
msgid ":kbd:`Alt+Shift+A` Switch all tracks active"
msgstr ":kbd:`Alt+Shift+A` Prepnúť všetky stopy na aktívne"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:435
msgid ":kbd:`Shift+A` Toggle all tracks active/inactive"
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift+A` Prepínanie všetkých stôp aktívne/neaktívne"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:437
msgid ":kbd:`A` Toggle track active"
msgstr ":kbd:`A` Prepínanie aktívnosti stopy"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:439
msgid ":kbd:`Shift+T` Toggle track target"
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift+T` Prepínanie cieľovej stopy"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:441
msgid ":ref:`Here you find more timeline shortcuts <ui-shortcuts_timeline>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Tu nájdete ďalšie skratky časovej osi <ui-shortcuts_timeline>`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:445
msgid "Timeline Edit Modes"
msgstr "Režim úpravy časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:450
msgid "Normal Mode"
msgstr "Normálny režim"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:452
msgid ""
"In this edit mode, you can not drag clips on top of other clips in the same "
"track in the timeline. You can drag them to another track in the timeline "
"but not into the same track at the same time point as an existing clip. "
"Contrast this to overwrite mode."
msgstr ""
"V tomto režime úprav nemôžete pretiahnuť klipy na iné klipy na rovnakej "
"stope časovej osi. Môžete ich pretiahnuť na inú stopu časovej osi, ale nie "
"na rovnakú stopu v rovnakom časovom bode ako existujúci klip. Porovnajte s "
"režimom prepisu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:457
msgid "Overwrite Mode"
msgstr "Režim prepisovania"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:459
msgid ""
"In this edit mode, you can drag a clip onto a track where there is an "
"existing clip and the incoming clip will overwrite that portion of the "
"existing clip (or clips) covered by the incoming clip."
msgstr ""
"V tomto režime úprav môžete pretiahnuť klip na stopu, kde sa nachádza "
"existujúci klip, a prichádzajúci klip prepíše tú časť existujúceho klipu "
"(alebo klipov), ktorú pokrýva prichádzajúci klip."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:465
#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:499
msgid "Before"
msgstr "Pred"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:471
msgid "After"
msgstr "Po"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:474
msgid ""
"In the \"After\" screenshot above, you can see that the clip which was "
"dragged from the upper track has replaced a portion of the clip on the lower "
"track."
msgstr ""
"Na snímke obrazovky „Po\" vyššie vidíte, že klip pretiahnutý z hornej stopy "
"nahradil časť klipu na dolnej stope."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:477
msgid "**Rearrange clips in the timeline**"
msgstr "**Preusporiadanie klipov na časovej osi**"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:480
msgid ""
"Performing a rearrange edit. This technique lets you quickly change the "
"order of clips in the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Vykonávanie úpravy preusporiadaním. Táto technika umožňuje rýchlo meniť "
"poradie klipov na časovej osi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:486
msgid ""
"Drag a clip, as you drop it to a new location performs an overwrite edit "
"that overwrites the existing clip."
msgstr ""
"Presuňte klip; keď ho pustíte na nové miesto, vykoná sa úprava prepísaním, "
"ktorá prepíše existujúci klip."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:491
msgid "Insert Mode"
msgstr "Mód vkladania"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:493
msgid ""
"With this mode selected and you drop a selection into the timeline the "
"selection will be inserted into the timeline at the point where the mouse is "
"released. The clip that the selection is dropped on is cut and clips are "
"moved to the right to accommodate the incoming clip."
msgstr ""
"Keď je tento režim vybratý a pustíte výber na časovú os, výber sa vloží na "
"časovú os v mieste, kde uvoľníte myš. Klip, na ktorý výber pustíte, sa "
"prestrihne a klipy sa posunú doprava, aby uvoľnili miesto pre prichádzajúci "
"klip."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:505
msgid "During"
msgstr "Počas"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:511
msgid ""
"After. Incoming Clip inserted. Clips after the insert point are shifted Right"
msgstr ""
"Po. Prichádzajúci klip bol vložený. Klipy za miestom vloženia sú posunuté "
"doprava"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:514
msgid "**Rearrange edit in the timeline**"
msgstr "**Úprava preusporiadaním na časovej osi**"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:516
msgid ""
"Performing a rearrange edit. Only clips in the destination track are "
"shifted; clips in other tracks are not affected. This technique lets you "
"quickly change the order of clips in the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Vykonávanie úpravy preusporiadaním. Posúvajú sa iba klipy v cieľovej stope; "
"klipy v ostatných stopách nie sú ovplyvnené. Táto technika umožňuje rýchlo "
"meniť poradie klipov na časovej osi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:518
msgid "It always closes all space in the track."
msgstr "Vždy uzavrie všetky medzery v stope."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:523
msgid ""
"Drag a clip, as you drop it to a new location. Releasing the clip performs "
"an insert edit that shifts clips in the destination track only."
msgstr ""
"Presuňte klip a pustite ho na nové miesto. Uvoľnenie klipu vykoná vkladaciu "
"úpravu, ktorá posúva klipy iba v cieľovej stope."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:529
msgid "Timeline Edit Tools"
msgstr "Nástroje na úpravu časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:532
msgid "Selection Tool"
msgstr "Nástroj pre výber"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:534
msgid ""
"Use this to select clips in the timeline. The cursor becomes a hand when "
"this tool is active."
msgstr ""
"Použite na výber klipov na časovej osi. Keď je tento nástroj aktívny, kurzor "
"sa zmení na ruku."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:538
msgid "Razor Tool"
msgstr "Nástroj pre rez"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:540
msgid ""
"Use this to cut clips in the timeline. The cursor becomes a pair of scissors "
"when this tool is active."
msgstr ""
"Použite na strihanie klipov na časovej osi. Keď je tento nástroj aktívny, "
"kurzor sa zmení na nožnice."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:542
#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:558
#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:582
#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:601
#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:634
msgid ":kbd:`ESC`: Return from any tools back to Selection tool."
msgstr ":kbd:`ESC`: Návrat z akéhokoľvek nástroja späť na nástroj výberu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:545
msgid "Spacer Tool"
msgstr "Nástroj pre medzeru"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:547
msgid ""
"Use this tool (|distribute-horizontal|) to temporarily group separate clips "
"and then drag them around the timeline to create or remove space between "
"clips. Very useful. Experiment with this tool to see how it works."
msgstr ""
"Použite tento nástroj (|distribute-horizontal|) na dočasné zoskupenie "
"oddelených klipov a ich presúvanie po časovej osi na vytváranie alebo "
"odstraňovanie medzier medzi klipmi. Veľmi užitočné. Experimentujte s týmto "
"nástrojom, aby ste videli, ako funguje."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:556
msgid ""
"In the above example, these clips are not grouped. However, the spacer tool "
"groups them temporarily for you so you can move them all as a group."
msgstr ""
"V uvedenom príklade tieto klipy nie sú zoskupené. Nástroj medzery ich však "
"dočasne zoskupí, aby ste ich mohli všetky presúvať ako skupinu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:564
msgid "Slip Tool"
msgstr "Nástroj pre medzeru"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:571
msgid ""
"Slip keeps the original duration of the clip. Like working with old film "
"material: beneath the given \"window\" of the clip length it slips the film "
"strip back and forth."
msgstr ""
"Posun zachováva pôvodnú dĺžku klipu. Je to podobné ako práca so starým "
"filmovým materiálom: v rámci daného „okna\" dĺžky klipu posúva filmový pás "
"dopredu a dozadu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:576
msgid ""
"Use Slip (|kdenlive-slip|) to trim, in a single operation, the IN and OUT "
"points of a clip forward or backward by the same number of frames, while "
"keeping the original duration and without affecting adjacent clips."
msgstr ""
"Použite Posun (|kdenlive-slip|) na orezanie, v jednej operácii, bodov IN a "
"OUT klipu dopredu alebo dozadu o rovnaký počet snímok, pričom sa zachová "
"pôvodná dĺžka a neovplyvnia sa susediace klipy."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:578
msgid ""
"You can slip multiple clips at once now: select all clips you want to slip "
"with the selection tool using :kbd:`Shift` then enable the slip tool and go "
"ahead…"
msgstr ""
"Teraz môžete posúvať viacero klipov naraz: vyberte všetky klipy, ktoré "
"chcete posúvať, pomocou nástroja výberu s :kbd:`Shift`, potom aktivujte "
"nástroj posunu a pokračujte…"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:580
msgid ""
"Slip can be done with the mouse, with the :kbd:`arrow` keys and with the "
"buttons on the monitor toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Posun možno vykonať myšou, klávesmi :kbd:`šípok` a tlačidlami na paneli "
"nástrojov monitora."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:588
msgid "Ripple Tool"
msgstr "Úprava zvlnenia"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:593
msgid ""
"Ripple changes the original duration of the clip. Like working with old film "
"material: You lengthen or shorten the film strip and move the adjacent clips "
"back and forth as you do that."
msgstr ""
"Zvlnenie mení pôvodnú dĺžku klipu. Je to podobné ako práca so starým "
"filmovým materiálom: predlžujete alebo skracujete filmový pás a súčasne "
"posúvate susediace klipy dopredu a dozadu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:595
msgid ""
"Use Ripple (|kdenlive-ripple|) to trim a clip and shift following clips in "
"the track by the number of frames you trim. When you shorten a clip by this "
"action all clips that follow the cut shift back in time, contrariwise, when "
"you extend a clip the clips after the cut shift forward in time. If an empty "
"space is on the track it behaves as a clip and it shifts in time as a "
"standard clip would be."
msgstr ""
"Použite Zvlnenie (|kdenlive-ripple|) na orezanie klipu a posunutie "
"nasledujúcich klipov v stope o počet orezaných snímok. Keď touto akciou klip "
"skrátite, všetky klipy za strihom sa posunú dozadu v čase; naopak, keď klip "
"predĺžite, klipy za strihom sa posunú dopredu v čase. Ak je na stope prázdny "
"priestor, správa sa ako klip a posúva sa v čase tak, ako by sa posúval "
"štandardný klip."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:597
msgid "You can Ripple only a single clip at once."
msgstr "Zvlnenie možno vykonať len na jednom klipe naraz."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:599
msgid "Ripple can be done with the mouse only."
msgstr "Zvlnenie možno vykonať iba myšou."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:607
msgid "Ripple Trim to Playhead"
msgstr "Zvlnené orezanie k prehrávacímu kurzoru"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:609
msgid ""
"To cut a clip on an active track at the playhead position without getting a "
"gap in the timeline do the following."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete prestrihnúť klip na aktívnej stope v pozícii prehrávacieho kurzora "
"bez vzniku medzery na časovej osi, postupujte nasledovne."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:611
msgid "enable ripple"
msgstr "aktivujte zvlnenie"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:613
msgid "place the playhead at the desired place"
msgstr "umiestnite prehrávací kurzor na požadované miesto"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:615
msgid ""
"hit :kbd:`(`: This cuts and removes the clip and space to the left side of "
"the playhead. :kbd:`)` does the same but to the right side of the playhead."
msgstr ""
"stlačte :kbd:`(`: Toto prestrihne a odstráni klip a priestor naľavo od "
"prehrávacieho kurzora. :kbd:`)` robí to isté, ale napravo od prehrávacieho "
"kurzora."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:621
msgid "Multicam Tool"
msgstr "Nástroj pre medzeru"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:626
msgid ""
"The multicam tool allows to cut between several cameras while playback is "
"running. Add your clips in different tracks, but at the same position in the "
"timeline and activate the multicam tool by going to menu :menuselection:"
"`Tool -> Multicam tool`. You may trim the clips in the desired track while "
"the timeline is playing by pressing their corresponding numbers (for track "
"V1, press key :kbd:`1`; for track V2 press key :kbd:`2`, etc…) or simply "
"select the desired track in the project monitor by clicking on it with the "
"mouse."
msgstr ""
"Nástroj multikamera umožňuje strihať medzi niekoľkými kamerami počas "
"prehrávania. Pridajte klipy do rôznych stôp, ale na rovnakú pozíciu na "
"časovej osi, a aktivujte nástroj multikamera v ponuke :menuselection:`Tool -"
"> Multicam tool`. Klipy v požadovanej stope môžete orezávať počas "
"prehrávania časovej osi stlačením príslušných čísiel (pre stopu V1 stlačte "
"kláves :kbd:`1`; pre stopu V2 stlačte kláves :kbd:`2` atď.) alebo jednoducho "
"vyberte požadovanú stopu v monitore projektu kliknutím na ňu myšou."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:628
msgid ""
"Select multicam tool will switch on the :ref:`ui-multitrack_view` in the "
"project monitor and set a marker at the current timeline position. You can "
"then seek/play to the wanted position, click on a track view in the project "
"monitor and it will lift all tracks except for the previously active track. "
"You can then repeat seek and click in another track to continue lifting "
"tracks."
msgstr ""
"Výber nástroja multikamera zapne :ref:`ui-multitrack_view` v monitore "
"projektu a nastaví značku na aktuálnu pozíciu časovej osi. Potom môžete "
"vyhľadať/prehrávať na požadovanú pozíciu, kliknúť na zobrazenie stopy v "
"monitore projektu a tým zdvihnúť všetky stopy okrem predtým aktívnej. Potom "
"môžete opakovať vyhľadávanie a kliknúť na inú stopu, aby ste pokračovali v "
"zdvíhaní stôp."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:630
msgid ""
"It doesn't stop playing when you perform the operation to avoid to lose the "
"rhythm and to work as you are working during a live broadcasting. If you "
"need to correct the editing you can manually stop and trim the cut as you do "
"when you video editing as normal."
msgstr ""
"Prehrávanie sa nezastaví, keď vykonávate operáciu, aby ste nestratili rytmus "
"a pracovali tak, ako pracujete počas živého vysielania. Ak potrebujete "
"opraviť úpravy, môžete manuálne zastaviť a orezať strih, ako to robíte pri "
"bežnom strihaní videa."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:632
msgid ""
"The audio tracks is not involved in the process as you generally use only "
"one audio track (the one which come from the main mixer to which the other "
"ones are synced to)"
msgstr ""
"Zvukové stopy sa nezúčastňujú na procese, keďže zvyčajne používate iba jednu "
"zvukovú stopu (tú, ktorá pochádza z hlavného mixéra, ku ktorému sú ostatné "
"synchronizované)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:640
msgid "Status Bar"
msgstr "Stavový riadok"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:649
msgid "Hints what you can do when you hover over items."
msgstr "Tipy na to, čo môžete robiť, keď podídete kurzor nad položky."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:651
msgid "Names of the clip you hover over in the timeline"
msgstr "Názvy klipu, nad ktorým podídete kurzor na časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:653
msgid ""
"Mode you are in (default is :guilabel:`Select` = :guilabel:`Normal Mode`)"
msgstr ""
"Režim, v ktorom sa nachádzate (predvolené je :guilabel:`Select` = :guilabel:"
"`Normal Mode`)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:655
msgid "Switch for :guilabel:`Color Tags`"
msgstr "Prepínač pre :guilabel:`Color Tags`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:657
msgid "Switch for :guilabel:`Video Thumbnails`"
msgstr "Ukazovať video náhľady"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:659
msgid ""
"Switch for :guilabel:`Audio Thumbnails`. Toggles zooming audio waveforms "
"from 1 (default) 2, 4, 8. It affects all displayed waveforms and all audio "
"tracks. See `Show Audio Thumbnails`_"
msgstr ""
"Prepínač pre :guilabel:`Audio Thumbnails`. Prepína priblíženie zvukových "
"priebehov od 1 (predvolené) 2, 4, 8. Ovplyvňuje všetky zobrazené priebeh a "
"všetky zvukové stopy. Pozri `Show Audio Thumbnails`_"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:661
msgid "Switch for :guilabel:`markers`. See `Show marker comments`_"
msgstr "Prepínač pre :guilabel:`markers`. Pozri `Show marker comments`_"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:663
msgid ""
"Switch for :guilabel:`Clip Names`, effect names and info in the timeline"
msgstr ""
"Prepínač pre :guilabel:`Clip Names`, názvy efektov a informácie na časovej "
"osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:665
msgid "Switch for :guilabel:`Snap`. See `Snap`_"
msgstr "Prepínač pre :guilabel:`Snap`. Pozri `Snap`_"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:667
msgid ":guilabel:`Fit Zoom to Project`. See `Fit Zoom to Project`_"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fit Zoom to Project`. Pozri `Fit Zoom to Project`_"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:669
msgid "Zoom Out"
msgstr "Oddialiť"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:671
msgid "Zoom slider `Zoom Project`_"
msgstr "Prispôsobiť priblíženie projektu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:673
msgid "Zoom In"
msgstr "Priblížiť"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:677
msgid "Split Audio and Video Automatically"
msgstr "Automatické rozdelenie zvuku a videa"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:679
msgid ""
"When this is on and you drag a clip to the timeline, the audio in the clip "
"will end up on an audio track and the video on a video track. You can "
"achieve the same result if you select the clip, :ref:`right_click_menu`, :"
"menuselection:`Split Audio`.  When this is off and you drag a clip onto the "
"timeline, both the audio and video tracks are combined into one video track."
msgstr ""
"Keď je toto zapnuté a pretiahnete klip na časovú os, zvuk klipu skončí na "
"zvukovej stope a video na video stope. Rovnaký výsledok dosiahnete, ak "
"vyberiete klip, :ref:`right_click_menu`, :menuselection:`Split Audio`. Keď "
"je toto vypnuté a pretiahnete klip na časovú os, zvuková aj video stopa sú "
"zlúčené do jednej video stopy."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:693
msgid "Show Video Thumbnails"
msgstr "Ukazovať video náhľady"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:695
msgid ""
"When on, the video clips in the timeline will contain thumbnails as well as "
"a filename. Otherwise, they just have the clip filename."
msgstr ""
"Keď je zapnuté, video klipy na časovej osi budú obsahovať miniatúry aj názov "
"súboru. V opačnom prípade majú iba názov súboru klipu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:697
msgid ""
"When the timeline is zoomed in to the maximum, the video track will show a "
"thumbnail for every frame in the clip. When the timeline is not on maximum "
"zoom, the video track will show a thumbnail for the first and last frame in "
"the clip."
msgstr ""
"Keď je časová os priblížená na maximum, video stopa zobrazí miniatúru pre "
"každú snímku klipu. Keď časová os nie je na maximálnom priblížení, video "
"stopa zobrazí miniatúru pre prvú a poslednú snímku klipu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:701
msgid "Show Audio Thumbnails"
msgstr "Ukazovať zvukové náhľady"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:703
msgid ""
"When on, the audio clip will have a wave representation of the audio data as "
"well as a filename.  Otherwise, they just have the clip filename."
msgstr ""
"Keď je zapnuté, zvukový klip bude mať vlnový diagram zvukových dát aj názov "
"súboru. V opačnom prípade majú iba názov súboru klipu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:707
msgid "Show marker comments"
msgstr "Zobraziť komentáre značiek"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:709
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This toggles on and off the display of :ref:`markers` saved within :doc:"
#| "`clips</project_and_asset_management/project_bin/clips>` (the text with "
#| "the gold background in the example below) and within :doc:`guides` (the "
#| "text with the purple background)."
msgid ""
"This toggles on and off the display of :ref:`markers` saved within :doc:"
"`clips </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/clips>` (the text with the "
"gold background in the example below) and within :doc:`guides` (the text "
"with the purple background)."
msgstr ""
"Toto prepína zobrazenie :ref:`markers` uložených v :doc:`klipoch</"
"project_and_asset_management/project_bin/clips>` (text so zlatým pozadím v "
"príklade nižšie) a v :doc:`guides` (text s fialovým pozadím)."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:716
msgid "Snap"
msgstr "Snap"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:718
msgid ""
"When this feature is on, dragging the beginning of one clip near to the end "
"of another will result at the end of the first clip snapping into place to "
"be perfectly aligned with the beginning of the second clip. As you move the "
"two ends near to each other, as soon as they get within a certain small "
"distance, they snap together so there is no space and no overlap. Note that "
"this occurs even if the clips are on different tracks in the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Keď je táto funkcia zapnutá, pretiahnutie začiatku jedného klipu blízko "
"konca druhého spôsobí, že koniec prvého klipu sa zachytí na miesto a "
"dokonale sa zarovná so začiatkom druhého klipu. Keď posúvate oba konce k "
"sebe, hneď ako sa dostanú do určitej malej vzdialenosti, priskočia k sebe, "
"takže nie je žiadna medzera ani prekrytie. Všimnite si, že k tomu dochádza "
"aj vtedy, keď sú klipy na rôznych stopách časovej osi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:721
msgid "Clips will also snap to the cursor position, markers and :doc:`guides`."
msgstr ""
"Klipy sa budú tiež zachytávať na pozíciu kurzora, značky a :doc:`guides`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:725
msgid "Fit Zoom to Project"
msgstr "Prispôsobiť priblíženie projektu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:727
msgid ""
"This will zoom the project out so that it all fits in the timeline window. "
"This is the same function that is triggered by :ref:`sequence_menu` Menu "
"item, :menuselection:`Fit Zoom to Project`."
msgstr ""
"Toto oddiali projekt tak, aby sa celý zmestil do okna časovej osi. Je to "
"rovnaká funkcia, ktorú spúšťa položka ponuky :ref:`sequence_menu`, :"
"menuselection:`Fit Zoom to Project`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:731
msgid "Zoom project"
msgstr "Priblíženie projektu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:733
msgid ""
"The magnifying glasses zoom in or out on the timeline. The slider adjusts "
"the zoom by large increments. These same settings are controlled by the :"
"menuselection:`Timeline` menu items, :menuselection:`Zoom In` and :"
"menuselection:`Zoom Out`."
msgstr ""
"Lupy priblížia alebo oddiaľujú časovú os. Posuvník upravuje priblíženie po "
"veľkých krokoch. Rovnaké nastavenia sú ovládané položkami ponuky :"
"menuselection:`Timeline`, :menuselection:`Zoom In` a :menuselection:`Zoom "
"Out`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:737
msgid "Cutting Footage from multiple aligned tracks - Ripple Delete"
msgstr "Strihanie záberov z viacerých zarovnaných stôp – Zvlnené vymazanie"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:743
msgid ""
"There are 4 possibilities for ripple delete (point 1 and 2 are the classical "
"`Ripple Delete`):"
msgstr ""
"Existujú 4 možnosti zvlneného vymazania (body 1 a 2 sú klasické `Ripple "
"Delete`):"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:745
msgid ""
"On the active track: Cut out the piece on the clip which you do not want "
"with :kbd:`Shift+R`. Right click on that piece and choose :menuselection:"
"`Extract Clip` or press :kbd:`Shift+Del`. This removes the clip and slides "
"everything else to the left to fill the gap. The playhead stays where you "
"made the last cut."
msgstr ""
"Na aktívnej stope: Vystrihnite časť klipu, ktorú nechcete, pomocou :kbd:"
"`Shift+R`. Kliknite pravým tlačidlom myši na túto časť a vyberte :"
"menuselection:`Extract Clip` alebo stlačte :kbd:`Shift+Del`. Tým sa klip "
"odstráni a všetko ostatné sa posunie doľava, aby sa vyplnila medzera. "
"Prehrávací kurzor zostane tam, kde ste vykonali posledný strih."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:747
msgid ""
"On the active track: Empty spaces between clips can only be removed by right "
"click on empty space and choose :menuselection:`Remove Space`."
msgstr ""
"Na aktívnej stope: Prázdne miesta medzi klipmi možno odstrániť iba kliknutím "
"pravým tlačidlom myši na prázdne miesto a výberom :menuselection:`Remove "
"Space`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:749
msgid ""
"On all tracks together: Mark `In` and `Out` points in the Project Monitor or "
"on the Timeline, then choose :menuselection:`Timeline --> Removal --> "
"Extract Timeline Zone` (or :kbd:`Shift+X`). Kdenlive deletes all footage "
"between the `In` and `Out` points in unlocked tracks, slides everything else "
"back to fill the gap, and puts the playhead on the In point."
msgstr ""
"Na všetkých stopách spolu: Označte body `In` a `Out` v monitore projektu "
"alebo na časovej osi, potom vyberte :menuselection:`Timeline --> Removal --> "
"Extract Timeline Zone` (alebo :kbd:`Shift+X`). Kdenlive vymaže všetky "
"záznamy medzi bodmi `In` a `Out` v odomknutých stopách, posunie všetko "
"ostatné späť na vyplnenie medzery a umiestni prehrávací kurzor na bod In."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:751
msgid ""
"On the active track with `Insert Mode`: Cut out the piece on the clip which "
"you don't want with :kbd:`Shift+R`. Hit `Delete`. This removes the clip and "
"slides everything else to the left to fill the gap. The playhead stays where "
"you made the last cut."
msgstr ""
"Na aktívnej stope s `Insert Mode`: Vystrihnite časť klipu, ktorú nechcete, "
"pomocou :kbd:`Shift+R`. Stlačte `Delete`. Tým sa klip odstráni a všetko "
"ostatné sa posunie doľava, aby sa vyplnila medzera. Prehrávací kurzor "
"zostane tam, kde ste vykonali posledný strih."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:753
msgid ""
"You can do a ripple trim to the playhead using :ref:"
"`ripple_trim_to_playhead`."
msgstr ""
"Zvlnené orezanie k prehrávacímu kurzoru môžete vykonať pomocou :ref:"
"`ripple_trim_to_playhead`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:759
msgid "3 point editing"
msgstr "Strih s 3 bodmi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:763
msgid ""
"3 important points to understand the 3 point editing concept (with keyboard "
"shortcuts):"
msgstr ""
"3 dôležité body na pochopenie konceptu strihu s 3 bodmi (s klávesovými "
"skratkami):"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:767
msgid "Source"
msgstr "Zdroj"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:773
msgid ""
"On the left of the track head the green vertical lines (V1 or A2). The green "
"line is connected to the source clip in the project bin. Only when a clip is "
"selected in the project bin, the green line shows up depending on the type "
"of the clip (A/V clip, picture/title/color clip, audio clip)."
msgstr ""
"Naľavo od hlavičky stopy sú zelené zvislé čiary (V1 alebo A2). Zelená čiara "
"je spojená so zdrojovým klipom v koši projektu. Zelená čiara sa zobrazí iba "
"vtedy, keď je klip vybraný v koši projektu, v závislosti od typu klipu (A/V "
"klip, obrázok/titulok/farebný klip, zvukový klip)."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:778
msgid "Target"
msgstr "Cieľ"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:784
msgid ""
"In the track head the target V1 or A1 is active when it’s yellow. An active "
"target track reacts to edit operations like insert a clip even if the source "
"is not active."
msgstr ""
"V hlavičke stopy je cieľ V1 alebo A1 aktívny, keď je žltý. Aktívna cieľová "
"stopa reaguje na operácie úprav, ako je vloženie klipu, aj keď zdroj nie je "
"aktívny."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:787
msgid "**The concept is like thinking of connectors**"
msgstr "**Koncept je ako premýšľanie o konektoroch**"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:789
msgid ""
"Connect the source (the clip in the project bin) to a target (a track in the "
"timeline). Only when both connectors on the **same** track are switched on "
"the clip “flow” from the project bin to the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Prepojte zdroj (klip v koši projektu) s cieľom (stopou na časovej osi). Iba "
"keď sú oba konektory na **rovnakej** stope zapnuté, klip „preteká\" z koša "
"projektu na časovú os."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:794
msgid "Active target tracks without connected source react on edit operations."
msgstr ""
"Aktívne cieľové stopy bez pripojeného zdroja reagujú na operácie úprav."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:797
msgid "Examples of advanced edit"
msgstr "Príklady pokročilých úprav"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:799
msgid "Here is a brief introduction to the 3 point editing system."
msgstr "Tu je stručný úvod do systému strihu s 3 bodmi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:805
msgid "Select a clip in the project bin with an up/down arrow"
msgstr "Vyberte klip v koši projektu pomocou šípky nahor/nadol"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:807
msgid ""
"Navigate the clip by the :kbd:`JKL` keys or by the :kbd:`left/right` arrows "
"and set the IN and the OUT point by the :kbd:`I` and :kbd:`O` keys."
msgstr ""
"Navigujte klip pomocou klávesov :kbd:`JKL` alebo šípok :kbd:`doľava/doprava` "
"a nastavte bod IN a OUT klávesmi :kbd:`I` a :kbd:`O`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:809
msgid "Hit :kbd:`T` to change to the timeline"
msgstr "Stlačte :kbd:`T` na prepnutie na časovú os"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:811
msgid ""
"Select a video or audio track in the timeline (up/down arrow key) and set it "
"as source with :kbd:`Shift + T`."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte video alebo zvukovú stopu na časovej osi (kláves šípky nahor/nadol) "
"a nastavte ju ako zdroj pomocou :kbd:`Shift + T`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:813
msgid ""
"Activate the track as a target with shortcut :kbd:`A` (this connects the "
"track to the source)"
msgstr ""
"Aktivujte stopu ako cieľ skratkou :kbd:`A` (tým sa stopa pripojí k zdroju)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:815
msgid ""
"Hit :kbd:`V` (insert) or :kbd:`B` (overwrite) to add the clip at the play-"
"head position or to fill the selected area in the timeline if it is active. "
"If you need to activate it use the :kbd:`G` key."
msgstr ""
"Stlačte :kbd:`V` (vložiť) alebo :kbd:`B` (prepísať) na pridanie klipu na "
"pozíciu prehrávacieho kurzora alebo na vyplnenie vybranej oblasti na časovej "
"osi, ak je aktívna. Ak ju potrebujete aktivovať, použite kláves :kbd:`G`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:823
msgid ""
"In the following example, we want only to insert the audio part of a clip in "
"A2 and we want to create a gap in all the other video and audio tracks:"
msgstr ""
"V nasledujúcom príklade chceme iba vložiť zvukovú časť klipu do A2 a chceme "
"vytvoriť medzeru vo všetkých ostatných video a zvukových stopách:"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:825
msgid "Activate all the target tracks which contain clips (yellow buttons)."
msgstr "Aktivujte všetky cieľové stopy, ktoré obsahujú klipy (žlté tlačidlá)."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:827
msgid "Activate just the audio source on A2"
msgstr "Aktivujte iba zvukový zdroj na A2"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:829
msgid "Press :kbd:`V` (insert)."
msgstr "Stlačte :kbd:`V` (vložiť)."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/editing.rst:833
msgid ""
"For more information about 3 point editing check :ref:`Advanced Timeline "
"Editing <advanced_timeline_editing>`"
msgstr ""
"Pre viac informácií o strihu s 3 bodmi pozrite :ref:`Advanced Timeline "
"Editing <advanced_timeline_editing>`"

